---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="Rituals - Danial Noe">
  <div class="max-w-2xl w-full text-left">
    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Morning Ritual</h1>
    <div style="background-color: #1a1a1a; padding-left: 1.5rem;" class="py-6 pr-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-red-600 shadow-lg mb-8">
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
        <li>wake up</li>
        <li>get out of bed immediately or I will not</li>
        <li>drink water from bottle</li>
        <li>turn on hot water kettle</li>
        <li>go pee and brush</li>
        <li>make cha</li>
        <li>breakfast - pb, overnight oatmeal, greek yogurt</li>
        <li>sit at desk, sip cha, and set 1-3 intentions for the day</li>
        <li>yoga</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-4xl font-bold mb-8">Nightly Ritual</h1>
    <div style="background-color: #1a1a1a; padding-left: 1.5rem;" class="py-6 pr-6 rounded-lg border-l-4 border-red-600 shadow-lg">
      <ul class="space-y-2 text-gray-300">
        <li>Digital Detox - no more screens</li>
        <li>Turn on red headlamp</li>
        <li>Reflect on day with Vow</li>
        <li>Gratitude of 3 things</li>
        <li>Set up coffee for the morning (beans grinded, water loaded, aeropress flipped)</li>
        <li>Brush and drink water</li>
        <li>Read for 10 min</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>